sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant UI as PrivateCorridor
    participant HM as hash-market
    participant R as btc-reporter
    participant BTC as BTC
    participant CH as cw-headstash
    participant OR as oracle
    participant Z as ZEC dest

    Note over U,Z: Phase 0 Preauth before fund
    U->>UI: ZEC dest plus rate policy
    UI->>UI: Seal DepositIntentV0 domain_bind terp-cashapp-intent-v0
    Note over UI: dest_owner_binding + min_out_value + expiry
    UI->>U: Fresh P2WPKH QR and intent_id

    Note over U,Z: Phase 1 Fund and observe
    U->>BTC: Fund deposit address
    UI->>HM: Open watch
    R->>BTC: Index UTXO
    R->>HM: Post observation
    HM-->>UI: deposit_observed SSE
    alt non-lab reverify fail
        UI->>BTC: Reverify observation
        UI--xUI: fail-closed stop no mint
    else reverify OK or lab_simulated
        UI->>BTC: Reverify when non-lab
    end

    Note over U,Z: Phase 2 Private mint
    UI->>CH: BridgeMintNote path
    alt double mint I4
        CH-->>UI: REJECT IsBridgeMinted / AlreadyMinted
    else first mint
        CH-->>UI: SeamNoteOutV0 owner_binding
    end

    Note over U,Z: Phase 3 Oracle-bound swap
    OR-->>UI: mid bounds only bound_only
    alt I1 I2 I3 I6 reject
        UI--xUI: intent_allows_swap fail-closed
    else accept preauth dest
        UI->>Z: Open only dest_owner_binding
    end
